CORE
main.py
--unwind 5
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
A method of an imported class calling a method of self defined later in the
class: the call was converted before the callee was registered and dropped
to a nondet result, so its effects vanished (`a.n == 0` was proved). Imported
classes are now converted a second time, as main-module classes are.
